+## Read Markdown beside chat
+
+Choose **Open Markdown**, then browse for an original file (macOS) or enter its path.
+Absolute paths can point outside this workspace; relative paths stay inside it, even
+through symlinks. Files must be UTF-8 `.md` or `.markdown`, at most 2 MB. Reading never
+writes documents or creates imported copies. This remains a trusted local app, not a
+filesystem sandbox: absolute-path reads are not limited to previously chosen files.
+
+The reader sanitizes HTML and omits images, embedded resources, and styling. Web/email
+links open only when clicked; relative and file links are disabled. Drag the divider
+or focus it and use arrow keys (Home/End for limits). Small screens stack reader and
+chat. Choose another file or close the reader without changing chat. The open path is
+remembered for this tab, and the pane width across reloads. Content refreshes after
+Pi finishes work, or with **Refresh**; it is not a filesystem watcher.
+
 ## How it works
 
 - **React + Vite** provide the app shell and live frontend updates.
